<title>MALTA: Arafat and Israel's Levy meet in Malta.</title>
<headline>Arafat and Israel's Levy meet in Malta.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat and Israeli Foreign Minister David Levy met in Malta on Wednesday in an effort to break a Middle East peace deadlock.</p>
<p>Paul Mifsud, Maltese official at a Euro-Mediterranean conference, told reporters:&quot;It (the meeting) is on.&quot;</p>
